   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Forbidden inside apply(): reading the clock, randomness, external I/O, iterating\nunordered collections. A single now() in apply() silently breaks reproducibility -\nand you will not discover it until an audit produces the wrong number months later.",
